### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
###  my-poc-project  —  IntelliJ HTTP Client
###  Base URL: http://localhost:8080
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. GET /api/v1/hello  –  Generic hello message
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hello
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. GET /api/v1/hello/{name}  –  Personalized hello
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hello/Joginder
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. GET /api/v1/health  –  Custom health endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

###

### 4. GET /actuator/health  –  Spring Boot Actuator health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. GET /actuator/metrics  –  All available metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. GET /actuator/metrics/{metric}  –  Specific metric
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/jvm.memory.used
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. GET /actuator/prometheus  –  Prometheus scrape endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus

###

### 8. GET /swagger-ui.html  –  Swagger UI (open in browser)
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger-ui.html

###

### 9. GET /v3/api-docs  –  Raw OpenAPI JSON spec
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. GET /h2-console  –  H2 database console (open in browser)
###     JDBC URL: jdbc:h2:mem:testdb  |  User: sa  |  Password: password
GET {{baseUrl}}/h2-console

###

